<title>PERU: Sunniside offers $37.0 mln for Peru's Banco Latino.</title>
<headline>Sunniside offers $37.0 mln for Peru's Banco Latino.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunniside International Ltd from the British Virgin Islands has offered to buy 30 percent of Peru's Banco Latino for $37.0 million, the Lima stock exchange said Friday.</p>
<p>The offer is based on a purchase of 2.49 million shares at a price of $14.85 per share, it said in a statement, adding the offer lasts until February 28.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
